    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"WebMergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebMergedContextConfiguration</code></a> if the test class in the\nsupplied <code>MergedContextConfiguration</code> is annotated with\n<a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a> and otherwise returns\nthe supplied instance unmodified.",
      "translation": "返回一个 `<a href=\"WebMergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebMergedContextConfiguration</code></a>`，如果供应的 `<code>MergedContextConfiguration</code>` 中的测试类使用 `<a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>` 注解；否则返回未修改的供应实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a> if the supplied class is\nannotated with <a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a> and\notherwise delegates to the superclass.",
      "translation": "返回<a href=\"WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a>，如果提供的类已用<a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>注解；否则委托给父类。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Web-specific implementation of the <a href=\"../TestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContextBootstrapper</code></a> SPI.\n\n<ul>\n<li>Uses <a href=\"WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a> as the default <a href=\"../ContextLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>ContextLoader</code></a>\nif the test class is annotated with <a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>\nand otherwise delegates to the superclass.\n</li><li>Builds a <a href=\"WebMergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebMergedContextConfiguration</code></a> if the test class is annotated\nwith <a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>.\n</li></ul>",
      "translation": "`TestContextBootstrapper` SPI 的 Web 特定实现。\n\n<ul>\n<li>如果测试类标注了<a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>，则使用<a href=\"WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a>作为默认的<a href=\"../ContextLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>ContextLoader</code></a>，否则委托给父类。\n</li><li>如果测试类标注了<a href=\"WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>，则构建一个<a href=\"WebMergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>WebMergedContextConfiguration</code></a>。\n</li></ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../support/DefaultTestContextBootstrapper.html#getDefaultContextLoaderClass(java.lang.Class)\">getDefaultContextLoaderClass</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"../support/DefaultTestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\">DefaultTestContextBootstrapper</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../support/DefaultTestContextBootstrapper.html#getDefaultContextLoaderClass(java.lang.Class)\">getDefaultContextLoaderClass</a></code>` 在类 `<code><a href=\"../support/DefaultTestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\">DefaultTestContextBootstrapper</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
