      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../support/AbstractTestContextBootstrapper.html#processMergedContextConfiguration(org.springframework.test.context.MergedContextConfiguration)\">processMergedContextConfiguration</a></code>` 类中的 `<code><a href=\"../support/AbstractTestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\">AbstractTestContextBootstrapper</a></code>`",
